1144
01:08:27,080 --> 01:08:28,080
Jaune 3!

1145
01:08:29,260 --> 01:08:30,320
Jaune 3!

1146
01:08:31,480 --> 01:08:32,580
Jaune 3!

1147
01:08:33,960 --> 01:08:35,080
Jaune 3!

1148
